Description: Backport published port access across isolated bridges
 Preserve Netavark's DNAT destination markings so forwarded published-port
 traffic is accepted before inter-bridge isolation is enforced.
Origin: backport, https://github.com/containers/netavark/pull/1483
Bug: https://github.com/containers/netavark/issues/709
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-27

